Package: PGSE
Title: An R interface for the Progressive Genome Segment Enhancement (PGSE) algorithm
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Alessandro", "Gerada", , "alessandro.gerada@liverpool.ac.uk", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-6743-4271"))
Description: PGSE is an algorithm that has been developed to predict phenotypes from
    bacterial whole genome sequencing data. This package provides an R interface
    and a set of S3 classes to support model training and prediction.
